flowchart TD
  subgraph OffChain[Off-Chain AI Attestation]
    AI[AI Agent / Risk Engine]
    Signer[Attestor Signer]
    Payload[AIAttestation Payload]
    AI --> Payload
    Payload --> Signer
  end

  subgraph OnChain[On-Chain Deterministic Verification]
    Registry[AIOracleRegistry\n(governed signer allowlist + policies)]
    Hub[AIAttestationHub\n(verify signature + nonce + expiry + layer)]
    Guard[PolicyGuard\n(OFF / ADVISORY / ENFORCE)]
    Target[SlashingManager.setFeePolicy\n(sensitive admin path)]
    Evidence[EvidenceAnchor\n(model cards + reports + configs)]
  end

  Signer -->|EIP-712 signature| Hub
  Hub -->|isSignerAllowed| Registry
  Hub -->|latest attestation by subject+layer| Guard
  Registry -->|policy thresholds| Guard
  Guard -->|enforcePolicy| Target
  Registry --> Evidence

  subgraph Governance[Governance / Timelock Control]
    Gov[Governor / Timelock / ProposalExecutor]
  end

  Gov -->|register/rotate signers| Registry
  Gov -->|setPolicy thresholds| Registry
  Gov -->|setMode / bypass| Guard
  Gov -->|anchor evidence| Evidence

  style OffChain fill:#0b132b,stroke:#1c2541,color:#ffffff
  style OnChain fill:#1b4332,stroke:#2d6a4f,color:#ffffff
  style Governance fill:#3a0ca3,stroke:#4361ee,color:#ffffff
